  "lyrics": [
    {
      "start": 3.55,
      "end": 6.05,
      "text": "也許會恨你",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.34,
      "end": 19.58,
      "text": "我知道我的脾氣不是很好",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.58,
      "end": 21.76,
      "text": "也許不一定",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.76,
      "end": 25.95,
      "text": "我知道我還是一樣愛著你",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.95,
      "end": 29.16,
      "text": "打開一瓶紅色的酒",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.16,
      "end": 32.38,
      "text": "看著金魚游來游去",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.38,
      "end": 36.88,
      "text": "是否我們都想要自由",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.97,
      "end": 44.18,
      "text": "我沒有關係",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.18,
      "end": 48.36,
      "text": "你可以假裝沒事離開這裡",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.36,
      "end": 50.6,
      "text": "一切好安靜",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.6,
      "end": 54.73,
      "text": "我只是想把情緒好好壓抑",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.73,
      "end": 57.97,
      "text": "到底誰會先說再見",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.97,
      "end": 61.17,
      "text": "我知道我一定哭泣",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.17,
      "end": 66.67,
      "text": "走的時候記得說愛我愛我",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.61,
      "end": 76.0,
      "text": "說愛我說愛我難道你不再愛我",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.0,
      "end": 82.4,
      "text": "我的淚滴下來你從來不曾看過",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.4,
      "end": 88.78,
      "text": "為什麼為什麼愛情讓人變沉重",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.78,
      "end": 95.4,
      "text": "沒有人告訴我原來不是我想像",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.4,
      "end": 103.2,
      "text": "不要回來你已經自由了",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.2,
      "end": 106.7,
      "text": "我也已經自由了",
      "source": "imported"
    },
